    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG John O'Brien are proud to present 'Carmel Cottage, Bree, Castleblayney, Co Monaghan' a fantastic four-bedroom detached dormer dwelling set on beautifully maintained grounds in a truly idyllic location. Offering the perfect blend of peaceful living and everyday convenience, this wonderful home is sure to appeal to families and those seeking a more relaxed lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, Carmel Cottage impresses with its mature, beautifully landscaped rear garden, providing a stunning backdrop and an abundance of outdoor space to enjoy throughout the seasons. Whether you're entertaining guests, gardening, or simply relaxing, the gardens offer a private and tranquil retreat.\r\n\r\nInside, the property boasts bright, spacious, and well-appointed accommodation designed for comfortable family living. The generous living areas are complemented by four well-proportioned bedrooms (two with ensuite's), creating a home that is both practical and welcoming.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a highly desirable location, Carmel Cottage enjoys the best of both worlds—peaceful surroundings while remaining within easy reach of local amenities, schools, and transport links.\r\n\r\nHomes of this quality in such an attractive setting rarely come to the market. 'Carmel Cottage' presents a fantastic opportunity to secure a beautiful family home with exceptional gardens in a prime location.\r\n\r\n**Luxury, comfort, and style await. Make this exceptional home yours**\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with DNG John O'Brien."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "FIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway: 6.4m X 2.1m\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 6.3m X 5.2m\r\nUtility Room: 1.8m x 1.4m\r\nLiving Room: 4.1m X 3.2m \r\n\r\nBedroom 1:  5.0m x 3.1m - with Patio doors\r\nBedroom 2: 4.1m x 3.3m\r\nFamily Bathroom: 3.8m x 2.1m\r\n\r\nSECOND FLOOR \r\n\r\nLanding: 3.6m x 2.2m\r\nBedroom 3: 4.5m X 3.1m - ensuite 1.7m x 1.7m\r\nBedroom 4: 2.5m X 2.5m - ensuite 2.3m x 1.8m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Quirky Bungalow in an exceptional location and walking distance to Castleblayney Town Centre. \r\nOil Central Heating\r\nFreshly painted throughout \r\nAlarmed\r\nStove In Living Room And Kitchen\r\nDG Windows & Doors\r\nWood And Tiled Flooring with new carpet on the stairs \r\nStunning Rear Patio Suntrap With Vast Garden\r\nPrivate on Site Car Parking"
      },
